Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"print\" url=\"ISic030208.jpg\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n         \u003C/surface>\n     -->\u003C/facsimile>\n    \u003Ctext>\n        \u003Cbody>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" subtype=\"primary\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"grc\" resp=\"#VM\">\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"section\" n=\"a\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Cmilestone unit=\"face\" n=\"a\"/>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003ChandShift new=\"#h2\"/>\u003CpersName type=\"attested\">\u003Cname type=\"idionym\">\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cseg part=\"F\">ε̄́σα\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">ρ\u003C/supplied>χος\u003C/seg>\u003C/name> \n                        \u003Clb n=\"2\"/>\u003Cname type=\"patronym\">\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cseg part=\"F\">εστράτο̄\u003C/seg>\u003C/name>\u003C/persName>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"section\" n=\"b\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Cmilestone unit=\"face\" n=\"b\"/>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003ChandShift new=\"#h1\"/>\u003CpersName type=\"attested\">\u003Cname type=\"idionym\">\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cseg part=\"F\">ας\u003C/seg>\u003C/name> \n                        \u003Clb n=\"2\"/>\u003Cname type=\"patronym\">\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cseg part=\"F\">νος\u003C/seg>\u003C/name>\u003C/persName>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"3\"/>\u003ChandShift new=\"#h2\"/>\u003Cnum value=\"14\">τετάρτα ἐπὶ δέκα\u003C/num>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\n                    \u003Capp>\n                        \u003Cnote>Text after Cordano 1992\u003C/note>\n                    \u003C/app>\n                \u003C/listApp>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\" xml:lang=\"en\">\n                \u003Cp/>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\" xml:lang=\"it\">\n                \u003Cp/>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"commentary\" xml:lang=\"en\">\n                \u003Cp>This document is one of a large deposit (c. 150) of lead tesserae found in a storeroom of Athena's sanctuary at the archaeological site of Kamarina.\n                The lamina appears to be used twice (see Cordano 1992, p. 58). In the second use, face a is used as face b and vice versa. The first text has not been erased \n                in order to engrave the second, therefore it is clearly visible.\n                For a similar reuse of the tesserae see also \u003Cref target=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic030197\">ISic030197\u003C/ref> and \n                \u003Cref target=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic030198\">ISic030198\u003C/ref>.\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"bibliography\">\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"edition\">\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Cordano\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1992\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>82b\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/XTMUJ38N\"/> \n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"SEG\">\n                        \u003Cdate>1992\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>42.0846\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/F2GG87EQ\"/>\n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"discussion\">\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"SEG\">\n                        \u003Cdate>2002\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>52.0920\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/F2GG87EQ\"/>\n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"SEG\">\n                        \u003Cdate>2004\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>54.0892\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/F2GG87EQ\"/>\n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n            \u003C/div>\n        \u003C/body>\n    \u003C/text>\n\u003C/TEI>\n"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
